00:00:27.021 --> 00:00:29.823
will produce a reasoned response and review it against

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:35.205
explicit criteria no assessor result is claimed Outcomes linked

00:00:35.231 --> 00:00:38.731
to this activity Item 1 of 5 EA-01 .

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:43.126
1 Translate an executive brief into agreed support priorities

